WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:12.560
How I started dancing?

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:21.800
I started dancing 
when I was still living with my mother.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:25.320
That was the moment I started dancing.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:34.280
When I dance, I feel free.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.720
I can do anything.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:44.720
I can show what I can do

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:47.160
and what I can't do.

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:54.840
And what I did before.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:10.760
"Faust", a play by Michael Elbe.

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:13.560
He's a director.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:19.440
He chose me to play God,

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:27.360
because he thought I would do a great job
and I did an audition.

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:32.160
I was God. I was so happy.

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:36.320
I say:
“Light! Let there be light!”

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:39.640
and that is how the play starts.

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:43.280
Music is a part of me.

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:48.440
When I don't have music around,

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:51.080
I can't be myself. 

